    "appendedText": "\n\n## Intraop acceptance batch 11 ? 2026-11-13\n\nAccepted all four requested live salvage singletons, with four scored nodes. EUA Crohn checkpoints, missing-gland sampling, gland preservation and EMR completion use the reviewed exact questions/nodes and their supported ENG-I01c/colonoscopy families. All versions stay needs_clinician_review. Five testing-choice waits are installed, including two authored biopsy_pathology aliases mapped to the established pathology_review runtime profile.\n\nBatch10 is confirmed as eleven cases and thirteen nodes. New-bile and sigmoid-defect-and-reassessment each have two scored nodes. The complete batches9?11 census contains 29 cases and 34 unique nodes, comprising eighteen live cases with 21 nodes and eleven clinic chart-review cases with thirteen nodes. The exact 34-row list and hashes are in docs/research/question-intraop-acceptance-batch11-20261113.md and its census JSON.\n\nDefault counts are 1436 cases, 1644 nodes, 1142 registered meanings and 943 scored meanings. Manifest v20 has 811 rows and JSON SHA256 5340b68f91005a22f3e75bf4208f566e1ccf948d40ced5578887ca83945ce9a9. Source and default hashes, the correction ledger, exact runtime waits, four direct Level5 bound inputs and all owned files are recorded in the report and JSON receipts.\n\nFinal validation has native exits. Full player 5552/5552 in 457 files. Clinical 3514 passed and eleven known batch10 failures in 235 files. Domain 6125 passed, 27 known failures and one skip in 226 files. Every residual failure title matches batch10. Focused clinical 109/109, native source/wait 5/5, focused player 20/20 including eight format-3/journal witnesses, seven workspace typechecks and 33 linter tests pass. Accepted cue lint is zero across four variants/eight contexts. Actual final pacing PASS at tick26377 with zero walkouts.\n\nHistorical adapters preserve exact prior epochs and all original captures/assertions. Reviewed question/node hashes match the accepted copies exactly. The three source authoring modules match intake bytes. Production metadata changes are limited to manifest/views/concepts and exact timing/order registration. Manager owns clinical sign-off, evidence rebind, backup and release integration. Local working-tree checkpoint.\n"
